# cap_g6_peer1_facades.oot — product facade signature peer
# Date: 2026-08-12
# Role: Peer1 (check / signature honesty)

## Scope

Static + check peer on CAP-G6 net/fs facade migration.

## Matrix

| Facade | Required token | Result |
|--------|----------------|--------|
| `ooda/std/os/net.oo` `http_get` | `&HttpCap` | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/net.oo` `net_get` | `&HttpCap` | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/net.oo` `net_tcp_connect` / write/read/close / tls | `&TcpCap` | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/net.oo` `net_tcp_bind` | `&BindCap` | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/net.oo` `net_bind_udp` / `net_udp_recv` | `&UdpCap` | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/net.oo` `net_sock_raw` | `&NetCap` (hard) | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/fs.oo` `fs_read_file` / path_exists / file_size | `&FsReadCap` | **PASS** |
| `ooda/std/os/fs.oo` `fs_write_file` | `&FsWriteCap` | **PASS** |
| external `std/src/net.oo` http_get/net_get | `&HttpCap` | **PASS** |
| external `std/src/fs.oo` read/write | FsRead/FsWrite | **PASS** |

## Check floors (G1/G2 sample)

| Case | Expect | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| HttpCap + fetch | allow | **PASS** |
| FsReadCap + read_file; FsWriteCap + write_file | allow | **PASS** |
| HttpCap + tcp_bind | deny | **PASS** |
| FsReadCap + write_file | deny | **PASS** |

## Residual named

- SysCap bulk: see `cap_g6_syscap_inventory.oot`
- Domain std NetCap residuals outside product facades (partial wave)
